{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫「Law霸女神」賴彥妤早前意外跌倒硬撼石櫈櫈角，心口和下巴受傷，左邊下巴最嚴重要縫8針，留下3、4吋疤痕，幸好傷口在下顎位置，位置算是不肯中之大幸，她說：「醫生縫針時我不斷催促，因為要趕住去拍《愛．回家之三代同糖》，全程就拍另一邊面避開</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:14:10.283508+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:33.883721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:33.883721+00:00","content_hash":"bad60e67e0d20acf646e6b108e2bb0aed9b9090fa254ae2f544efe764e0dd5ea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}